description=Local Build 42 port of Anomalous Storm (Workshop 2779946812). Red sky, staged rain and thunder, gradual exposure effects, and 10% zombie speed. Exposed zombies and animals take per-minute damage with a random 0.75x-2.25x actor factor; damage ramps after the configurable lethal-exposure point instead of killing everyone at once. Fixed-screen Halo notices announce storm phases and when all loaded exposed creatures have died, including in single-player. Exposure skips actors whose squares have no loaded chunk. The red overlay also works in Viewpoint while preserving True Weathers settings. Original Workshop files remain untouched.
